  "verified": [
    "Six proposal38 baseline transactions permit editor removal while the original transaction is open. Each synthetic baseline rolls back its operation and preserves counted work; no provider call or production exploit is claimed.",
    "All168 corrected races observe actual competing-session locks across six operation boundaries, seven role proofs, both orderings and commit/rollback; refusal or rollback leaves exact prior records/capacity unchanged.",
    "All23 component cases pass natively: legitimate flows, exact retry at capacity, paused completion, stronger isolation refusal, Owner without proof, foreign actor, private execution refusal, metadata/grant drift refusal and installer rollback.",
    "Full225+39 replay as restricted postgres verifies only the five exact routine-body insertions change. Their OIDs/modes/owners/paths/grants and every unrelated preexisting public routine are preserved. The new invoker helper matches its exact body and stays private; the paused read-only drain remains clear and provider quiescence remains unproven.",
    "Unpatched proposal37 summary source admission permits editor removal to commit while an admitted source read remains open; one real two-session reproduction passes.",
    "Proposal38 holds the real role and explicit student editing proof. All28 corrected summary races cover both orderings, commit/rollback and seven proof categories; every source read preserves exact job/provenance/lease/capacity state.",
    "All17 functional/installation cases pass natively, including lost access, app/service helper refusal, drift refusal, unpaused/held refusal and installer rollback. Complete225+38 restricted-owner replay preserves reader mode/path/owner/grants and the existing text protocol.",
    "All28 actual Apply authority-removal races pass: seven proof categories, both operation orderings and commit/rollback. Real blocking sessions are observed. Refused/rolled-back Apply writes nothing and retains its capacity unit; committed Apply settles once. Partner-only gating remains separate from retained editor grants.",
    "Reviewer identity/time cannot be changed before real Apply; completed review fields cannot be changed afterward. False initial completion remains refused and exact revision-only operations preserve every other field.",
    "Actual Apply/automatic settlement and private no-save recovery remain valid across roles, rollback and stale/fresh claim cases; partner-only/unrelated Owner remain refused.",
    "The actual TypeScript manual-save handler is checked against SQL for seven role categories, intentional clearing, stale/deleted/completed rows and lost successful replies without retry.",
    "Unpaused/held-work installation is refused; installation rollback restores the old guard.",
    "Complete225+37 replay verifies exact marker guard, exact-only protocol inventory replacement and unchanged owners/modes/paths/grants, paused empty shared work.",
    "Corrected actual-app initialization lookup and all56 writer regressions pass; all prior suites and core1660 case inventories pass without failures/skips."
